        {
          "book": "1JN",
          "chapter": 3,
          "verse": 4
        }
      ],
      "en": "Everyone who sins also commits lawlessness. Sin is lawlessness.",
      "ko": "죄를 짓는 자마다 불법을 행하나니 죄는 불법이라",
      "source_text_hash": "cc7c2690d0815bdafe59ec76aa3757d708e1ad93735c60d2f5658b458470049b",
      "translation_text_hash": "61bde07213e99b07c3f114ece8fab515b9e9912b33a57aba4e8bda811abdf9da",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "죄를 짓는 자마다 불법을 행하나니 죄는 불법이라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "61bde07213e99b07c3f114ece8fab515b9e9912b33a57aba4e8bda811abdf9da"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:1JN:3:5",
      "sequence": 30581,
