      ],
      "en": "unlike Cain, who was of the evil one and killed his brother. Why did he kill him? Because his deeds were evil, and his brother’s righteous.",
      "ko": "가인 같이 하지 말라 저는 악한 자에게 속하여 그 아우를 죽였으니 어찐 연고로 죽였느뇨 자기의 행위는 악하고 그 아우의 행위는 의로움이니라",
      "source_text_hash": "7fb3c57482ac5bdf281623668dd9298dfac0e412716d3c0b97dd2993f7909a46",
      "translation_text_hash": "14b32291d077f1de8bb1ad42e55be1122c8559fa6a02c4e098ad817fad2b6789",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
